diff --git a/docs/concepts/hooks-and-overrides.rst b/docs/concepts/hooks-and-overrides.rst
index 43d5f28..a25ce84 100644
--- a/docs/concepts/hooks-and-overrides.rst
+++ b/docs/concepts/hooks-and-overrides.rst
@@ -22,7 +22,19 @@ Comparison
 
    * - Aspect
      - Per-Package Overrides
-     - Global Hooks
+     - ``is_pre_built`` override
+------------------------
+
+``PackageBuildInfo.is_pre_built(version)`` calls the ``is_pre_built``
+override with ``version`` and ``variant`` keyword arguments, but only when
+a version is given.  The version has its local segment removed.  Return
+``True`` or ``False`` to override the YAML settings, or ``None`` to defer
+to them.  Without a version, the variant default is returned and the hook
+is not called.
+
+.. versionadded:: 0.95.0
+
+Global Hooks
    * - **Scope**
      - One named package
      - Every package
